  <Docs>
    <summary>Abstract base response class for PccSandboxManager.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Abstract base response class for PccSandboxManager.egressData operations.</para>
      <para>Since the interfaces do not extend Parcelable, they cannot be passed directly as AIDL parameters. The AIDL compiler generates code that tries to call Parcel.readTypedObject(EgressResponse.CREATOR), which triggers compilation errors (cannot find symbol: variable CREATOR and incompatible type bounds). Therefore, this base class implements Parcelable and provides the base unmarshalling stubs.</para>
      <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/privatecompute/EgressResponse" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.app.privatecompute.EgressResponse</code>.</a></format></para>
